---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PlannerCTA from '../../components/PlannerCTA.astro';
import SelectSaunasButton from '../../components/SelectSaunasButton.astro';

const faqSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is the difference between LeisureCraft's Dundalk and Canadian Timber collections?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "LeisureCraft says the Dundalk Collection uses Western Red Cedar, while Canadian Timber primarily uses Eastern White Cedar at a more accessible price point. Both are built in the company's Ontario factory, but model details and warranties should be checked individually."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Are LeisureCraft saunas delivered assembled?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Many LeisureCraft saunas are sold as prefabricated kits for on-site assembly. The exact crate, delivery, assembly, heater, roofing, and installation scope depends on the model and retailer."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How long is the LeisureCraft sauna warranty?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Do not rely on one generic number. LeisureCraft's published limited-warranty document and current collection pages are not fully consistent. Ask the seller to identify the exact warranty document for the selected model and put covered parts, exclusions, labor, and claim handling in writing."
      }
    }
  ]
};
---
<Base
  title="Dundalk LeisureCraft Sauna Review: Collections, Kits, and Buyer Fit"
  description="A source-backed Dundalk LeisureCraft review covering current sauna collections, wood choices, kit assembly, warranties, retailer questions, and total project cost."
  canonical="/brands/dundalk-leisurecraft-review"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />

  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <header class="mb-8">
      <p class="text-sm text-amber-700 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Desk-researched brand guide</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-stone-900 leading-tight mb-4">Dundalk LeisureCraft Sauna Review</h1>
      <p class="text-stone-500 text-sm">Reviewed August 2026 &middot; 9 min read</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-stone-700 mt-4">LeisureCraft offers a broad Canadian-made outdoor sauna catalog. The strongest reason to shortlist it is choice: barrel, cabin, pod, Luna, and modern cube formats across different wood and design collections. The hard part is comparing the exact package, not the brand name.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-8">
      <img src="/images/lifestyle/barrel-sauna-field.jpg" alt="Representative outdoor barrel sauna in a grassy setting" class="w-full object-cover max-h-80" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800" />
    </div>

    <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-lg p-5 mb-8 text-sm text-stone-700">
      <p><strong>Commercial disclosure:</strong> We may earn a commission when you buy through the Select Saunas link on this page. This is a desk-researched buyer analysis, not a hands-on test. The image above is representative and is not presented as a specific LeisureCraft model.</p>
    </div>

    <section class="bg-stone-900 text-white rounded-lg p-6 mb-8">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-300 mb-2">Short answer</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">A useful shortlist when the exact collection, model, and installer fit.</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-200 mb-5">LeisureCraft now organizes its sauna catalog into Dundalk, Canadian Timber, and Pure Cube collections. Wood, wall construction, glass, roofing, heater options, bench layout, and assembly details vary. Treat each model as its own project.</p>
      <a href="https://leisurecraft.com/all-saunas" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md bg-amber-400 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-stone-900 hover:bg-amber-500" data-track-event="brand_outbound_click" data-cta-position="dundalk_above_fold">See LeisureCraft's current sauna catalog</a>
    </section>

    <PlannerCTA
      source="dundalk_review_after_verdict"
      heading="Prepare the site before comparing kit quotes"
      description="Put your location, dimensions, heat preference, electrical status, installation needs, budget, and timeline into one project brief. Your answers stay in your browser unless you explicitly submit them for manual review."
    />

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-5">Understand the three collections</h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-10">
      <table class="w-full min-w-[720px] border-collapse text-sm">
        <thead><tr class="bg-stone-100 text-left"><th class="p-3 border-b border-stone-300">Collection</th><th class="p-3 border-b border-stone-300">Current manufacturer description</th><th class="p-3 border-b border-stone-300">Buyer question</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td class="p-3 border-b border-stone-200 font-semibold">Dundalk</td><td class="p-3 border-b border-stone-200">Western Red Cedar in barrel, panoramic barrel, cabin, Luna, POD, and indoor formats.</td><td class="p-3 border-b border-stone-200">Which model, cedar grade, roof, windows, benches, and heater are included?</td></tr>
          <tr class="bg-stone-50"><td class="p-3 border-b border-stone-200 font-semibold">Canadian Timber</td><td class="p-3 border-b border-stone-200">Primarily Eastern White Cedar, positioned as the more accessible line with barrel, cabin, Luna, MiniPOD, and related wellness products.</td><td class="p-3 border-b border-stone-200">Which lower price comes from material, options, warranty, or retailer scope?</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="p-3 border-b border-stone-200 font-semibold">Pure Cube</td><td class="p-3 border-b border-stone-200">Modern designs with larger glass areas and different exterior and wall configurations.</td><td class="p-3 border-b border-stone-200">How do glass, insulation, privacy, foundation, and heater sizing affect this site?</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">What can be verified</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-3 text-stone-700 mb-8">
      <li><strong>Canadian manufacturing:</strong> LeisureCraft describes its operation as a Canadian manufacturer and identifies its factory in Melancthon, Ontario.</li>
      <li><strong>Collection-level wood distinction:</strong> Current LeisureCraft materials separate Western Red Cedar in the Dundalk line from primarily Eastern White Cedar in Canadian Timber.</li>
      <li><strong>Kit assembly:</strong> The company publishes model-specific assembly instructions and videos for prefabricated kits.</li>
      <li><strong>Multiple heater paths:</strong> Current manuals show that exact models may support electric or wood-burning options. The selected heater manual still controls its installation.</li>
      <li><strong>Product variety:</strong> Current catalogs include barrel, cabin, Luna, POD, and cube-style outdoor rooms rather than a single construction type.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">What this review cannot verify</h2>
    <div class="border-l-4 border-amber-500 bg-amber-50 p-5 mb-8 text-sm text-stone-700">
      <p class="mb-3">We have not measured stave tolerances, heat loss, heat-up time, bench temperature, installed lifespan, or warranty service. We also cannot support the old article's claim that one brand lasts a fixed number of years longer than another.</p>
      <p>Manufacturer construction claims are useful inputs. They are not a substitute for the exact drawing, manual, quote, delivered bill of materials, and site-specific installation plan.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Assembly is part of the product decision</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-4">LeisureCraft's published manuals are detailed enough to show that these are real installation projects. The work can include base preparation, wall or stave assembly, benches, roof components, vents, lights, and heater coordination. The exact sequence changes by model.</p>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-6">Before ordering, decide who receives the freight, checks for damage, moves parts from the curb, protects them from weather, verifies the base, assembles the room, installs the roof, and coordinates the heater. A low product price can become an expensive project when those tasks are left undefined.</p>
    <a href="https://leisurecraft.com/catalog" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md border border-stone-300 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-amber-700 hover:border-stone-500">Open the current LeisureCraft catalog</a>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Resolve the warranty before paying</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-4">There is a discrepancy in current official material. LeisureCraft's published limited-warranty document states five years for products it manufactures and excludes service, labor, and installation costs. The current Canadian Timber collection page mentions a three-year warranty. That may reflect a collection-specific term, a content update, or another distinction.</p>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-6">Do not guess. Ask the retailer to attach the exact warranty document for the model and order date. Confirm the covered components, original-owner rules, registration, exclusions, replacement-parts process, freight, labor, heater warranty, and who handles the claim.</p>
    <a href="https://leisurecraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Assembly-Instructions-1-2.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md border border-stone-300 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-amber-700 hover:border-stone-500">Read LeisureCraft's published limited warranty</a>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Questions for the retailer</h2>
    <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-3 text-stone-700 mb-10">
      <li>What is the exact collection, model number, wood species, grade, and bill of materials?</li>
      <li>Which roof, floor, porch, changeroom, windows, benches, and accessories are included?</li>
      <li>Is the heater included? If so, what exact model, control, stones, guard, and chimney or electrical scope apply?</li>
      <li>What are the crate dimensions, freight method, unloading requirement, and damage-reporting deadline?</li>
      <li>Which foundation drawings and site tolerances must be met before delivery?</li>
      <li>Who provides assembly, electrical or chimney work, permits, inspection, and startup?</li>
      <li>Which warranty document applies to every major component?</li>
      <li>What is in stock now, what is made to order, and which date is a commitment rather than an estimate?</li>
    </ol>

    <section class="bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-lg p-6 mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">Compare current retailer listings</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-stone-700 mb-4">Select Saunas currently maintains a dedicated Dundalk LeisureCraft collection. Prices, stock, bundles, and delivery terms can change. Confirm the exact model and total project scope before buying.</p>
      <SelectSaunasButton collection="dundalk-leisurecraft" label="See current Dundalk listings" ctaPosition="dundalk_current_collection" />
    </section>

    <div class="bg-stone-900 text-white rounded-lg p-6 mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Compare installed cost, not catalog price</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-200 mb-4">Put the sauna, heater, freight, unloading, foundation, roofing, electrical or chimney work, assembly, permits, tax, and maintenance into the same budget.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/tools/sauna-cost-calculator/?ref=dundalk_review&campaign=project_budget&placement=dundalk_bottom" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md bg-amber-400 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-stone-900 hover:bg-amber-500" data-track-event="calculator_cta_clicked" data-cta-position="dundalk_bottom">Build the project budget</a>
        <a href="/guides/barrel-sauna-vs-cabin-sauna/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md border border-stone-500 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-white hover:border-stone-300">Compare barrel and cabin formats</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
